{"seq":2,"slug":"upgradeable-contracts","title":"可升级合约安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/practice/upgradeable-contracts","wordCount":726,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"可升级合约安全\">可升级合约安全</h1><p>智能合约的不可变性是其信任基础，但也意味着 bug 无法热修复。可升级模式（Proxy Pattern）通过将逻辑与存储分离来解决这个矛盾——代理合约持有状态，通过 DELEGATECALL 执行可替换的实现合约逻辑。然而，可升级性本身引入了一整类新的攻击面，OWASP Smart Contract Top 10 2026 首次将其列为独立漏洞类别（SC10）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可升级合约的安全性依赖于<strong>升级机制的正确性</strong>和<strong>存储布局的一致性</strong>这两个不变式的持续维持。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    USER[用户调用] --&gt; PROXY[代理合约]&#10;    PROXY --&gt; |DELEGATECALL| IMPL_V1[实现V1]&#10;    PROXY --&gt; |升级后DELEGATECALL| IMPL_V2[实现V2]&#10;&#10;    subgraph 代理合约_存储&#10;        S1[EIP-1967 slot: admin]&#10;        S2[EIP-1967 slot: implementation]&#10;        S3[业务数据 slot 0+]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 攻击面&#10;        A1[未保护的升级函数]&#10;        A2[存储布局碰撞]&#10;        A3[未初始化实现]&#10;        A4[选择器冲突]&#10;        A5[selfdestruct残留]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    IMPL_V1 -.-&gt; A2&#10;    IMPL_V1 -.-&gt; A3&#10;    PROXY -.-&gt; A1&#10;    PROXY -.-&gt; A4\">flowchart TB\n    USER[用户调用] --&gt; PROXY[代理合约]\n    PROXY --&gt; |DELEGATECALL| IMPL_V1[实现V1]\n    PROXY --&gt; |升级后DELEGATECALL| IMPL_V2[实现V2]\n\n    subgraph 代理合约_存储\n        S1[EIP-1967 slot: admin]\n        S2[EIP-1967 slot: implementation]\n        S3[业务数据 slot 0+]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 攻击面\n        A1[未保护的升级函数]\n        A2[存储布局碰撞]\n        A3[未初始化实现]\n        A4[选择器冲突]\n        A5[selfdestruct残留]\n    end\n\n    IMPL_V1 -.-&gt; A2\n    IMPL_V1 -.-&gt; A3\n    PROXY -.-&gt; A1\n    PROXY -.-&gt; A4</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代理模式</th>\n<th>升级责任</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>风险点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Transparent Proxy</td>\n<td>Admin (代理层)</td>\n<td>简单、角色分离</td>\n<td>Admin 函数选择器冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UUPS</td>\n<td>实现合约自身</td>\n<td>Gas 更低、可移除升级能力</td>\n<td><code>_authorizeUpgrade</code> 可能遗漏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Beacon Proxy</td>\n<td>外部 Beacon 合约</td>\n<td>批量升级多个代理</td>\n<td>Beacon 本身成为单点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Diamond (EIP-2535)</td>\n<td>Facet 粒度升级</td>\n<td>突破合约大小限制</td>\n<td>复杂度极高、选择器管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"存储布局碰撞\">存储布局碰撞</h2><p>DELEGATECALL 在代理的存储上下文中执行实现的代码。如果升级后的实现改变了变量声明顺序，变量会读写错误的存储槽：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// 实现 V1&#10;contract VaultV1 {&#10;    address public owner;     // slot 0&#10;    uint256 public totalDeposited; // slot 1&#10;    mapping(address =&gt; uint256) public balances; // slot 2&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 实现 V2 — 错误的升级&#10;contract VaultV2 {&#10;    uint256 public totalDeposited; // slot 0 — 碰撞 owner!&#10;    address public owner;     // slot 1 — 碰撞 totalDeposited!&#10;    mapping(address =&gt; uint256) public balances; // slot 2&#10;    uint256 public rewardRate; // slot 3 — 新变量应在末尾添加&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 实现 V2 — 正确的升级&#10;contract VaultV2 {&#10;    address public owner;     // slot 0 — 保持不变&#10;    uint256 public totalDeposited; // slot 1 — 保持不变&#10;    mapping(address =&gt; uint256) public balances; // slot 2 — 保持不变&#10;    uint256 public rewardRate; // slot 3 — 只在末尾添加新变量&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 实现 V1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract VaultV1 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    address public owner;     // slot 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 public totalDeposited; // slot 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapping(address => uint256) public balances; // slot 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 实现 V2 — 错误的升级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract VaultV2 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 public totalDeposited; // slot 0 — 碰撞 owner!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    address public owner;     // slot 1 — 碰撞 totalDeposited!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapping(address => uint256) public balances; // slot 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 public rewardRate; // slot 3 — 新变量应在末尾添加</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 实现 V2 — 正确的升级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract VaultV2 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    address public owner;     // slot 0 — 保持不变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 public totalDeposited; // slot 1 — 保持不变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapping(address => uint256) public balances; // slot 2 — 保持不变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint256 public rewardRate; // slot 3 — 只在末尾添加新变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>EIP-7201 命名空间存储模式提供了更安全的方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// EIP-7201: 每个逻辑模块使用独立的存储命名空间&#10;abstract contract VaultStorageV1 {&#10;    // keccak256(abi.encode(uint256(keccak256(&quot;vault.storage.v1&quot;)) - 1))&#10;    // &amp; ~bytes32(uint256(0xff))&#10;    bytes32 private constant STORAGE_LOCATION =&#10;        0x...specific_hash...;&#10;&#10;    struct VaultStorage {&#10;        address owner;&#10;        uint256 totalDeposited;&#10;        mapping(address =&gt; uint256) balances;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function _getVaultStorage() internal pure returns (VaultStorage storage $) {&#10;        assembly {&#10;            $.slot := STORAGE_LOCATION&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 升级时添加新存储命名空间，不影响旧的&#10;abstract contract RewardsStorageV2 {&#10;    bytes32 private constant REWARDS_LOCATION =&#10;        0x...different_hash...;&#10;&#10;    struct RewardsStorage {&#10;        uint256 rewardRate;&#10;        mapping(address =&gt; uint256) rewards;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function _getRewardsStorage() internal pure returns (RewardsStorage storage $) {&#10;        assembly {&#10;            $.slot := REWARDS_LOCATION&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// EIP-7201: 每个逻辑模块使用独立的存储命名空间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abstract contract VaultStorageV1 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // keccak256(abi.encode(uint256(keccak256(\"vault.storage.v1\")) - 1))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // &#x26; ~bytes32(uint256(0xff))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bytes32 private constant STORAGE_LOCATION =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        0x...specific_hash...;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    struct VaultStorage {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        address owner;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 totalDeposited;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        mapping(address => uint256) balances;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function _getVaultStorage() internal pure returns (VaultStorage storage $) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assembly {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            $.slot := STORAGE_LOCATION</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 升级时添加新存储命名空间，不影响旧的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abstract contract RewardsStorageV2 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bytes32 private constant REWARDS_LOCATION =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        0x...different_hash...;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    struct RewardsStorage {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint256 rewardRate;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        mapping(address => uint256) rewards;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function _getRewardsStorage() internal pure returns (RewardsStorage storage $) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assembly {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            $.slot := REWARDS_LOCATION</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"未初始化实现攻击\">未初始化实现攻击</h2><p>实现合约部署后如果没有被正确&quot;锁定&quot;，攻击者可以调用其 <code>initialize()</code> 函数获取控制权：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// 漏洞：实现合约可被任何人初始化&#10;contract VaultImpl is Initializable, UUPSUpgradeable {&#10;    address public owner;&#10;&#10;    function initialize(address _owner) public initializer {&#10;        owner = _owner;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function _authorizeUpgrade(address) internal override {&#10;        require(msg.sender == owner);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 攻击步骤：&#10;// 1. 找到未初始化的实现合约地址&#10;// 2. 调用 VaultImpl(impl).initialize(attacker)&#10;// 3. 攻击者成为 owner&#10;// 4. 调用 upgradeToAndCall(maliciousImpl, ...)&#10;// 5. 新实现包含 selfdestruct 或任意逻辑\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 漏洞：实现合约可被任何人初始化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract VaultImpl is Initializable, UUPSUpgradeable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    address public owner;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function initialize(address _owner) public initializer {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        owner = _owner;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function _authorizeUpgrade(address) internal override {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(msg.sender == owner);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 攻击步骤：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 1. 找到未初始化的实现合约地址</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 2. 调用 VaultImpl(impl).initialize(attacker)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 3. 攻击者成为 owner</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 4. 调用 upgradeToAndCall(maliciousImpl, ...)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 5. 新实现包含 selfdestruct 或任意逻辑</span></span></code></pre></div><p>正确防御：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// OpenZeppelin 推荐模式&#10;contract VaultImpl is Initializable, UUPSUpgradeable {&#10;    /// @custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow constructor&#10;    constructor() {&#10;        _disableInitializers(); // 实现合约的构造函数中禁用初始化&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    function initialize(address _owner) public initializer {&#10;        __UUPSUpgradeable_init();&#10;        owner = _owner;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// OpenZeppelin 推荐模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract VaultImpl is Initializable, UUPSUpgradeable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /// @custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow constructor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    constructor() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _disableInitializers(); // 实现合约的构造函数中禁用初始化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function initialize(address _owner) public initializer {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        __UUPSUpgradeable_init();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        owner = _owner;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"uups-升级权限漏洞\">UUPS 升级权限漏洞</h2><p>UUPS（Universal Upgradeable Proxy Standard）将升级逻辑放在实现合约中。如果 <code>_authorizeUpgrade()</code> 实现不当，任何人都可以升级合约：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// 危险：空的升级授权&#10;contract BrokenUUPS is UUPSUpgradeable {&#10;    function _authorizeUpgrade(address newImplementation) internal override {&#10;        // 缺少权限检查！任何人都可以调用 upgradeTo()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 安全实现&#10;contract SecureUUPS is UUPSUpgradeable, OwnableUpgradeable {&#10;    function _authorizeUpgrade(address newImplementation)&#10;        internal&#10;        override&#10;        onlyOwner  // 明确的权限检查&#10;    {&#10;        // 可选：验证新实现的代码哈希&#10;        require(&#10;            newImplementation.code.length &gt; 0,&#10;            &quot;Not a contract&quot;&#10;        );&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 危险：空的升级授权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract BrokenUUPS is UUPSUpgradeable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function _authorizeUpgrade(address newImplementation) internal override {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 缺少权限检查！任何人都可以调用 upgradeTo()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 安全实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>contract SecureUUPS is UUPSUpgradeable, OwnableUpgradeable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    function _authorizeUpgrade(address newImplementation)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        internal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onlyOwner  // 明确的权限检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 可选：验证新实现的代码哈希</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        require(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            newImplementation.code.length > 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"Not a contract\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"函数选择器冲突\">函数选择器冲突</h2><p>EVM 用函数签名的 Keccak256 前 4 字节作为选择器。代理的 admin 函数与实现的业务函数可能意外共享相同选择器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"solidity\" data-code=\"// 选择器冲突示例&#10;// collate_propagate_storage(bytes16) 的选择器 = 0xa9059cbb&#10;// transfer(address,uint256) 的选择器 = 0xa9059cbb&#10;// 两个完全不同的函数共享相同的 4 字节选择器！&#10;&#10;// Transparent Proxy 的解决方案：&#10;// Admin 调用 → 走 admin 函数（升级/管理）&#10;// 非 Admin 调用 → 走 fallback → delegatecall 到实现&#10;// 代价：每次调用都要检查 msg.sender == admin\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 选择器冲突示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// collate_propagate_storage(bytes16) 的选择器 = 0xa9059cbb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// transfer(address,uint256) 的选择器 = 0xa9059cbb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 两个完全不同的函数共享相同的 4 字节选择器！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Transparent Proxy 的解决方案：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Admin 调用 → 走 admin 函数（升级/管理）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 非 Admin 调用 → 走 fallback → delegatecall 到实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 代价：每次调用都要检查 msg.sender == admin</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    CALL[函数调用] --&gt; CHECK{msg.sender == admin?}&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|是| ADMIN[执行代理admin函数]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|否| FALLBACK[fallback → DELEGATECALL]&#10;    FALLBACK --&gt; IMPL[实现合约执行]&#10;&#10;    subgraph 冲突风险&#10;        ADMIN_FUNC[&quot;admin函数: upgradeTo(address)&quot;]&#10;        IMPL_FUNC[&quot;业务函数: collate_propagate_storage(bytes16)&quot;]&#10;        ADMIN_FUNC -.-&gt;|选择器相同!| CONFLICT[0xa9059cbb]&#10;        IMPL_FUNC -.-&gt;|选择器相同!| CONFLICT&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    CALL[函数调用] --&gt; CHECK{msg.sender == admin?}\n    CHECK --&gt;|是| ADMIN[执行代理admin函数]\n    CHECK --&gt;|否| FALLBACK[fallback → DELEGATECALL]\n    FALLBACK --&gt; IMPL[实现合约执行]\n\n    subgraph 冲突风险\n        ADMIN_FUNC[\"admin函数: upgradeTo(address)\"]\n        IMPL_FUNC[\"业务函数: collate_propagate_storage(bytes16)\"]\n        ADMIN_FUNC -.-&gt;|选择器相同!| CONFLICT[0xa9059cbb]\n        IMPL_FUNC -.-&gt;|选择器相同!| CONFLICT\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"升级安全检查清单\">升级安全检查清单</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>验证方法</th>\n<th>严重度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实现合约构造函数调用 <code>_disableInitializers()</code></td>\n<td>代码审查</td>\n<td>Critical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>_authorizeUpgrade()</code> 有 onlyOwner 或等效保护</td>\n<td>代码审查 + 测试</td>\n<td>Critical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>升级不改变存储布局顺序</td>\n<td>OpenZeppelin Upgrades 插件</td>\n<td>Critical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新变量只在存储末尾添加</td>\n<td>存储布局 diff</td>\n<td>High</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>没有 <code>selfdestruct</code> 在实现中</td>\n<td>代码搜索</td>\n<td>Critical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>升级受时间锁保护</td>\n<td>架构审查</td>\n<td>High</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>升级前后运行完整测试套件</td>\n<td>CI/CD</td>\n<td>High</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# OpenZeppelin Upgrades 插件自动检查存储兼容性&#10;npx hardhat run scripts/upgrade.js&#10;# 或 Foundry&#10;forge script script/Upgrade.s.sol --verify\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># OpenZeppelin Upgrades 插件自动检查存储兼容性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hardhat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> scripts/upgrade.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或 Foundry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forge</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> script</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> script/Upgrade.s.sol</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --verify</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可升级合约用 DELEGATECALL 分离逻辑与状态，但引入了存储碰撞和权限新攻击面</li>\n<li>EIP-7201 命名空间存储是当前最安全的存储布局方案</li>\n<li>实现合约必须在构造函数中 <code>_disableInitializers()</code>，防止被抢先初始化</li>\n<li>UUPS 的 <code>_authorizeUpgrade()</code> 必须包含明确的权限检查</li>\n<li>升级操作应受多签 + 时间锁保护，并在升级前后自动验证存储兼容性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"audit-workflow\">安全审计流程</a>——如何在审计中系统性检查可升级合约</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../fintech-fundamentals/smart-contracts/solidity-fundamentals\">金融科技基础：Solidity 基础</a>——Solidity 语言特性的基础参考</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可升级合约安全","id":"可升级合约安全"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"存储布局碰撞","id":"存储布局碰撞"},{"level":2,"text":"未初始化实现攻击","id":"未初始化实现攻击"},{"level":2,"text":"UUPS 升级权限漏洞","id":"uups-升级权限漏洞"},{"level":2,"text":"函数选择器冲突","id":"函数选择器冲突"},{"level":2,"text":"升级安全检查清单","id":"升级安全检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"安全审计流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/practice/audit-workflow"},"next":{"title":"安全事件响应与监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/smart-contract-security/practice/incident-response"}}